Z||000002||ChadMan||05-19-2000||02:05 PM||||Thumbs up on:<BR>The V6 with those sweet-looking trumpets sticking out of the factory bumper cutouts<BR>The clean tan/brown interior<BR>The white-face gauges<BR>The "Fiero" emblem where the power-mirror switch would go, and on the door-pull surrounds<BR>The leather-wrapped steering wheel<BR>The driving lights<BR>The red-painted shock-tower plates<BR>The "Fiero" mask on your third brake light<BR>The V6 deserves another mention<P>A respectful thumbs down on:<BR>The wing and SE body cladding, unless you paint them red<BR>The "PONTIAC" lettering on the taillamps (sorry)<P>I assume you don't have the Formula/GT rear sway bar.  How does your Coupe handle with the V6?  Does your Isuzu gearbox seem happy with the V6?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Dan86gt3.8||05-19-2000||02:17 PM||||I hate to be picky but is there no covers for the temp/fuel gauges?  they still look black||||reg||1
Z||000004||TheFiero64||05-19-2000||02:29 PM||||<BR>I  have now painted the wing, But not the SE body cladding. I know I had a problem with the temp gauge and didn't get to the white faces yet. Thanks for being honest I love honest remarks. They help me improve on my ride <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>The isuzu 5 speed runs great with the v6. the gearing seems good for the v6. I have heard the isuzu is less notchy than the getrag. <P>P.S. I love my <B>sweet-looking trumpets</B>. That is the best exhaust tips they make(just my opinion) <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Formula||05-19-2000||07:05 PM||||I like the exhaust tips the most.<BR>I like the fog lights the second most.<BR>I like the gauges the third most.<BR>nice car!<P>I think you should do monkeys taillight mod, I think you should order black for the inside and red for the outside!!<P>I also like the color of your interior, I wish mine was beige and not grey.||||reg||1
